5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry our instincts about promise have not aged well. I want to see what finished awards actually delivered.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,Money is easy to vote. Trained hands are not. I need to know who is genuinely available here now.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Nothing runs in isolation. I am concerned about the state of the shared facilities we all rely on.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The headline grant size looks static, but what it buys is shifting. I need to know the cost structure.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,Too many awards lost time to non-scientific interruptions. I want to know where work in this field gets stuck.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, that is a fair point. The value of the money matters as much as the amount.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Victoria, shared facilities are a bottleneck. If they fail, the science stops regardless of the grant.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, exactly. Capacity is the hidden variable. I will look into the current status of those services.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the ledgers to see which costs are absorbed centrally and which land on us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I will look at incident logs and schedule overruns to find where the friction lies.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will review the closeout files of past awards to see which ones truly earned their keep.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the staffing rolls and the minutes on secondments to gauge our actual crew strength.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities to see if we have room to breathe.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the national computing agreement to see if simulation costs are covered.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will look at the station records from partner field sites to see if external factors are causing delays.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It is better to look at the past than to guess at the future.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Data on availability is more reliable than hope.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Let us see what the infrastructure can actually support before we commit.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Understanding the financial floor is essential for a rational decision.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we can identify the friction points before they become problems.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
