34,2,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The closeout files are sobering. Catalogue-style awards still draw users a decade later.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The staffing rolls are alarming. Most phenotyping technicians left for industry.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The spectroscopy suite was idle for eleven weeks. That is a significant risk for any project.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Simulation hours are free under the new agreement, but animal day rates have risen sharply.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Three field sites lost a whole season to flooding. The repository turnaround, however, is now fast.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, if simulation is free, that changes the calculus for computational projects.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Victoria, if the spectroscopy suite is unreliable, we cannot rely on it for critical data.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, the animal facility is accredited and has vet cover, but the glasshouses are booked solid.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, if field sites are unstable, indoor work is safer, but the glasshouses are full.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, the schedule overruns for breeding colonies are double those for computation.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"So, mechanism-focused awards often end with questions unresolved, while catalogues endure.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We have modelling analysts seconded abroad until autumn. That is a gap in our capacity.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"The glasshouse crew is at full strength, but the space is the constraint, not the people.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The bench-fee subsidy for glasshouse space is extended, which helps with the cost side.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The repository migration is done. Deposits clear in weeks, not years. That is a major plus.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,We must weigh the durability of the output against the risk of the process.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,The lack of technicians is a real threat to any project needing hands-on phenotyping.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"The shared instrumentation risk is high, but the animal facility is stable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The financial picture is mixed: free compute, but expensive animals and stable glasshouse costs.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"The field risks are high, but the data infrastructure is now robust.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
